<title>HONG KONG: Tsim Sha Tsui interim net rises 32 pct.</title>
<headline>Tsim Sha Tsui interim net rises 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   30.0     vs 23.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0     vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net				378.49 vs   287.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,499.72 vs 1,567.97</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tsim Sha Tsui Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 16-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Tsim Sha Tsui Properties has interests in property development, hotels and restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
